codex
The race is broader than the two reported lines: the suite has several snapshots taken after EOF. The concrete gap is in `HEVUDPAssociationConnection.close`: it closes the socket before notifying the adapter to remove the connection and release queue charges. I’m timing a pre-fix full-suite run now and will preserve the reported historical 3/24 baseline plus this task-scoped reproduction result.
