codex
The same anomaly recurred: this test’s default real 10-second idle timer expires under full-suite scheduling pressure before its second callback. It is independent of the snapshot seam, but it prevents the required full-run gate. I’m making that non-idle test deterministic by injecting the suite’s manual clock; this changes no adapter semantics and adds no sleep or polling.
